    public static int countUpper(String s) {
        int count = 0;
        for (int i = 0; i < s.length(); i++) {
            String ch = s.substring(i, i + 1);
            if (ch.compareTo("A") >= 0 && ch.compareTo("Z") <= 0) {
                count++;
            }
        }
        return count;
    }
```

