stimulus.description:
A game allows a player a limited number of actions. Write the LimitedCounter class described below.
```java
public class LimitedCounter {
    // to be written in this question:
    //   constructor LimitedCounter(int limit)
    //   boolean increment()
    //   void reset()
    //   int remaining()
}
```

parts.model_answer:
One correct implementation (ALTON reference answer):
```java
public class LimitedCounter {
    private int limit;
    private int count;

    public LimitedCounter(int limit) {
        this.limit = limit;
        count = 0;
    }
    public boolean increment() {
        if (count < limit) {
            count++;
            return true;
        }
        return false;
    }
    public void reset() {
        count = 0;
    }
    public int remaining() {
        return limit - count;
    }
}
```

